  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop tomato and cucumber.\n• In a small bowl, combine tomato and cucumber. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper, then toss.\n• Roughly chop brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478cfbcb653703ca99c51/step-126b4e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478cfbcb653703ca99c51/step-ab374f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins. Add beans and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in tomato paste and Mexican fiesta spice blend (add less if you’re sensitive to heat) and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the water, stock powder, butter and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Lightly mash beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478cfbcb653703ca99c51/step-a212d720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between bowls.\n• Top with bean mixture, Cheddar cheese and sour cream (see ingredients). Serve with tomato salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478cfbcb653703ca99c51/step-6b592330.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
